<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97296" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στροφ-εῖον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>twisted noose, cord</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.29
			</span></i> (gen. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στροφίων</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>machine</i> used in the theatre in representing heroes
			translated to heaven or dying at sea or in war, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.127
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				132
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>windlass, capstan</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nav.</u>
				5
			</span></i>: hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στροφεῖα, τά</span>, perh. <i>dues payable by ships for the use of
				a windlass</i>, i.e. <i>harbour-dues,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				11(2).138
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				8
			</span></i>(Delos, <span class="entity">iv/iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				203
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				30
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στροφεύς</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, Kourouniotes 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐλευσινιακά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.190
				</span></i>
			 (Eleusis, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>, pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρόφιον</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				33 iii 5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>.</div>
